OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland farm profits
OL,4,Atopped #1bn in 2025
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland farming industry
OL,7,Fsaw profits surge by 36% in real terms
OL,8,Flast year, reaching more than #1bn for
OL,9,Fthe first time.
OL,11,FThe profit is calculated by assessing
OL,12,Fthe value of output and subsidies and
OL,13,Fsubtracting the cost of production and
OL,14,Ffinance.
OL,16,FTotal output was up by 12% to #3.6bn,
OL,17,Fwhile input costs increased marginally
OL,18,Fto #2.2bn.
OL,20,FFarming profits are volatile,
OL,21,Finfluenced by external factors like
OL,22,Fglobal markets and the weather.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
